comparison_method: "Original input fixture; structured cases run tq -o json and tq -o toon. Ordered JSON values use the shared numeric normalizer; whitespace and object key order do not matter. Raw CLI cases retain their arguments and are assessed separately. Unicode scalar counts include all stdout framing and newlines. Size totals include only successful jq/JSON/TOON-equivalent cases using default encoder layouts, not compact JSON. No tokenizer measurement."
